Alembic migrations for pharmacy-monitor.

Quick reference:
  alembic upgrade head                    Apply all migrations
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m msg  Create new migration from models
  alembic downgrade -1                    Rollback one
  alembic history                         Show migration tree
  alembic current                         Show current DB revision

Migration strategy:
  - Initial migration (versions/0001_initial.py) captures the entire current
    schema as exported from src/storage.py models.
  - For SQLite → PostgreSQL migration, run: scripts/sqlite_to_pg.py AFTER
    `alembic upgrade head` against the empty Postgres DB.
